  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The name says it all: "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "caldo",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "caldo"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " verde means green broth. A smooth potato base is the backdrop for kale cut into fine "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "chiffonade",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "chiffonade"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " ribbons and fried chorizo floated on top. It is one of those soups that works at any hour."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Slice the greens as thin as you can. Fine ribbons cook quickly and stay silky rather than tough."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
